# Docker build contexts of this repository are the folders with a Dockerfile (infra/*, src/Web/procure-ai-web), plus a repository-root
# context for anything that builds from the whole tree. Keep the context small and free of local state.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/.git
**/.vs/
**/.playwright-cli/
.superpowers/
.github/
**/*.user
**/TestResults/
